  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p><a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-strict-request-input\"></a></p>\n                                        <hr>\n\n                    <p>Laravel 13.40 adds a strict flag to the request integer(), boolean(), float(), and string() helpers, so bad input returns your default instead of 0 or an error.</p>\n\n                    <p>The post <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-strict-request-input\">Strict Request Input Casting in Laravel</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel News</a>.</p>\n                    <p>Join the <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/newsletter\">Laravel Newsletter</a> to get <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel</a> articles like this directly in your inbox.</p>\n\n                    </body></html>",
